{"status": "ok", "message-type": "work", "message-version": "1.0.0", "message": {"indexed": {"date-parts": [[2026, 7, 21]], "date-time": "2026-07-21T22:45:16Z", "timestamp": 1784673916472, "version": "3.55.0"}, "reference-count": 0, "publisher": "Viser Technology Pte Ltd", "issue": "3", "license": [{"start": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 30]], "date-time": "2025-06-30T00:00:00Z", "timestamp": 1751241600000}, "content-version": "unspecified", "delay-in-days": 0, "URL": "https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc/4.0"}], "content-domain": {"domain": [], "crossmark-restriction": false}, "short-container-title": ["JSCS"], "abstract": "<jats:p>冰雪体育旅游的高质量发展需要新质生产力。在经济新常态下，发挥新质生产力的赋能作用以助力冰雪体育旅游高质量发展，尤为重要。采用文献资料、逻辑分析等研究方法，首先从理论基础出发，阐释新质生产力、冰雪体育旅游高质量发展的相关理论概念，其次对当前我国冰雪体育旅游的发展现状进行研究分析，了解冰雪体育旅游发展中所面临的实际问题。研究发现当前我国冰雪体育旅游发展中存在资源配置不均衡、产业运营模式单一、基础设施不完善及人才短缺等问题，制约着冰雪体育旅游的发展进程。为加快新质生产力对冰雪体育旅游的赋能作用，结合我国冰雪体育旅游发展的实际，提出实践路径如下：（1）优化资源配置；（2）探索多元发展路径；（3）完善基础设施；（4）加强冰雪体育专业人才培养。</jats:p>", "DOI": "10.33142/jscs.v5i3.16935", "type": "journal-article", "created": {"date-parts": [[2025, 7, 28]], "date-time": "2025-07-28T01:58:23Z", "timestamp": 1753667903000}, "page": "89", "source": "Crossref", "is-referenced-by-count": 19, "title": ["新质生产力赋能冰雪体育旅游高质量发展研究"], "prefix": "10.33142", "volume": "5", "author": [{"given": "金平", "family": "戴", "sequence": "first", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}, {"given": "兵", "family": "李", "sequence": "additional", "affiliation": [], "role": [{"vocabulary": "crossref", "role": "author"}]}], "member": "18588", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 30]]}, "container-title": ["体能科学"], "original-title": [], "link": [{"URL": "https://journals.viserdata.com/index.php/jscs/article/viewFile/16935/17176", "content-type": "application/pdf", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "text-mining"}, {"URL": "https://journals.viserdata.com/index.php/jscs/article/viewFile/16935/17176", "content-type": "unspecified", "content-version": "vor", "intended-application": "similarity-checking"}], "deposited": {"date-parts": [[2025, 7, 28]], "date-time": "2025-07-28T01:58:24Z", "timestamp": 1753667904000}, "score": 1, "resource": {"primary": {"URL": "https://journals.viserdata.com/index.php/jscs/article/view/16935"}}, "subtitle": [], "short-title": [], "issued": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 30]]}, "references-count": 0, "journal-issue": {"issue": "3", "published-online": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 30]]}}, "URL": "https://doi.org/10.33142/jscs.v5i3.16935", "relation": {}, "ISSN": ["2810-9066", "2810-9058"], "issn-type": [{"value": "2810-9066", "type": "electronic"}, {"value": "2810-9058", "type": "print"}], "subject": [], "published": {"date-parts": [[2025, 6, 30]]}}}